{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12104030","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12104030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1210402001:1":{"text":"这个造船厂比满满想象中大太多了。","source_cn":"这个造船厂比满满想象中大太多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB03ED49FC82896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210402002:0":{"text":"辛巴达，这个造船厂……好像没有船？","source_cn":"辛巴达，这个造船厂……好像没有船？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD90060B27760300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210402003:1":{"text":"瞧那城墙上的大炮，炮口锃亮锃亮的。你确定这是造船厂吗？怎么感觉更像军工厂？","source_cn":"瞧那城墙上的大炮，炮口锃亮锃亮的。你确定这是造船厂吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090C35805E8FBEEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210402004:1":{"text":"不管是造船厂，还是军工厂，总之都是武器厂，也没什么关系吧？难道就因为是军工厂，你们就不走这条路了吗？","source_cn":"不管是造船厂，还是军工厂，总之都是武器厂，也没什么关系...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EAC181E785053FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1210402004":{"text":"不管是造船厂，还是军工厂，总之都是武器厂，也没什么关系吧？难道就因为是军工厂，你们就不走这条路了吗？","source_cn":"不管是造船厂，还是军工厂，总之都是武器厂，也没什么关系吧？难道就因为是军工厂，你们就不走这条路了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EAC181E785053FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210402005:1":{"text":"总感觉……辛巴达没有对我们坦诚呢。","source_cn":"总感觉……辛巴达没有对我们坦诚呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2BB26CDA1EED3E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210402006:0":{"text":"好啦，别猜了。我承认，没有对你们说实话。因为这里是干什么的，其实是一个秘密情报。","source_cn":"好啦，别猜了。我承认，没有对你们说实话。因为这里是干什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82107F7D5B66701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210402007:0":{"text":"如果你们——小心！","source_cn":"如果你们——小心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB13973EE7FA865EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210403001:0":{"text":"哇……这就是魔法师的力量吗？竟然能挡下炮弹？","source_cn":"哇……这就是魔法师的力量吗？竟然能挡下炮弹？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50837C387A28C646","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"哇……这就是魔法师的力量吗？竟然能挡下炮弹？","female":"哇……这就是魔法师的力量吗？竟然能挡下炮弹？","variant_male_record_index":"128032","variant_female_record_index":"128033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210403002:1":{"text":"谁在开炮？！","source_cn":"谁在开炮？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600D6F8ABAA65394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210403003:1":{"text":"你们几个娃子！我看见你们了！乖乖爬上来，不然就再吃一炮！","source_cn":"你们几个娃子！我看见你们了！乖乖爬上来，不然就再吃一炮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8864E250504E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210403004:0":{"text":"呃……不好，我们被发现了！","source_cn":"呃……不好，我们被发现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B98DDFABE80010D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210403005:0":{"text":"怎么办，我们要听他的话上去吗？","source_cn":"怎么办，我们要听他的话上去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C60B83B125CB6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210403006:1":{"text":"不要！万一他是骗我们的……我们已经吃了几次亏了。","source_cn":"不要！万一他是骗我们的……我们已经吃了几次亏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B0ABD63B15AE9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210403007:1":{"text":"不错，很警觉嘛。","source_cn":"不错，很警觉嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B7390E352C7E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1210403007":{"text":"不错，很警觉嘛。","source_cn":"不错，很警觉嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B7390E352C7E7C","v